4349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822034_1140515897967682_1398700426869903642_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_HojX0WXH2MQ7kNvwEKqx5t&_nc_oc=AdrMUWbZtvCoZvanCHM8DwP32hu23H0IC_17q686P1kH8UEDz5CtRF3aswzmahpwNxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0uqHoR_Wr00Ozg72wmy6UqhKi4d9VAxknJsOqvTyjwA&oe=6B005C0D"}, {"file_name": "Untitled4_20250907035112.png", "id": "1141157131247946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821955_1141157134581279_8548405454433956294_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uNgreFcs16AQ7kNvwFDKnb0&_nc_oc=AdpwaFvDCJpRFv1zoOQGjidabgaR1rmzJHXuDrxBwOKsQZkzH0BPIs2dxR2Iw_3yLzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRNk-PELXACzscVslpp4TJj79x-MFQ8ZXv2QYgXym5sjw&oe=6B006866"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gibbon Redux", "keywords": ["Gibbon", "Redux", "Ape"], "long_description": "# Survival Through Silence\n\nGibbon Redux is a VR horror game inspired by Lethal Ape and The Underrooms. Trapped in a massive research facility, you must survive against a smart, sound-sensitive monster that hunts your every move.\n\nEvery step matters\u2014the creature can hear your footsteps, forcing you to balance speed with silence as you explore dark corridors and hidden passages.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n- A large, atmospheric facility map\n\n- Monster AI that reacts to sound and player behavior\n\n- Free cosmetics\n\n- Buyable mod menus\n\n- High-quality VR graphics\n\n\nCan you outsmart the AI and make it out alive?", "short_description": "Gibbon Redux is inspired by games like Lethal Ape, The Underrooms, Lethal Ape Redux, And more. The game contains a facility in which the player must avoid a smart deadly monster."}]}, "developer_name": "MitchellGamz", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gibbon-redux/priva